From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:18:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 157/162] GreatDANE: apply Keeper lazy-node contract (EDE
 14/22, retry, 503)

Wire the confirmed keeper/lazy-node API. --lazy and
GREATDANE_NODE_LAZY=1 stay, and are passed only when
greatdane.node.lazy is on. Other node tunables keep their defaults.

Treat SERVFAIL+EDE 14 (Not Ready) and EDE 22 (fetch failed, retrying)
as retryable loading, never as NXDOMAIN, no_tlsa, or a TLSA/cert
failure. Honor /gd/tlsa retry_ms inside the 10s budget. A proxy
CONNECT 503 with X-GreatDANE-Status: loading and Retry-After becomes
GD_ZONE_LOADING with auto-retry. In lazy mode, _synced uses the
stdio namespace_synced field when present.

Stub tests cover EDE 14/22, retry_ms, and the 503 loading response.
Do not push.
